.devenv
.env

# Cargo build output. `devenv.nix` points CARGO_TARGET_DIR here, so maturin's build of the Python
# extension lands in it too. `Cargo.lock` stays tracked — rs/ builds a binary, not a library.
rs/target/

# Obsidian: vendored community-plugin bundles (4.7 MB of Excalidraw) and per-user UI state.
# Shared vault config (app/appearance/core-plugins/graph) stays tracked.
docs/vault/.obsidian/plugins/
docs/vault/.obsidian/workspace.json
cases-snake*.json
